    "content": "DBQs are VA's standardized exam forms. A private treating provider can complete one, giving VA rating-ready evidence in the schedule's own language — often the single highest-leverage document a veteran can bring to a claim. Initial PTSD exams generally must be done by a VA/VA-contracted psychologist or psychiatrist (the PTSD 'initial' DBQ is not veteran-submittable); REVIEW PTSD DBQs and most physical DBQs can be private. Bring the relevant DBQ, your symptom log, and this app's evidence packet to the appointment.",
